      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    par_value = 1000\n    coupon_rate = 0.10\n    spot_1_year = 0.06\n    forward_1_year_from_year_1 = 0.08\n    forward_1_year_from_year_2 = 0.10\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    coupon_payment = par_value * coupon_rate\n    discount_factor_1 = 1 / (1 + spot_1_year)\n    discount_factor_2 = discount_factor_1 / (1 + forward_1_year_from_year_1)\n    discount_factor_3 = discount_factor_2 / (1 + forward_1_year_from_year_2)\n\n    bond_value = (\n        coupon_payment * discount_factor_1\n        + coupon_payment * discount_factor_2\n        + (coupon_payment + par_value) * discount_factor_3\n    )\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(bond_value, 3)\n```",
